        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, from natural gas
Translated name: Strom, ab Erdgas
Included processes: Electricity mix for the region.

The mix of electricity generation technologies in the region is collected from international energy statistics.  The dataset uses the average net efficiency of power plants in each region, weighed by each region's electricity production from natural gas. 

Production Volume: 352974 GWh 
Data source: ENTSO-E Power Statistics: https://www.entsoe.eu/publications/data/power-stats/2024/monthly_domestic_values_2024.xlsx

Representativeness: 100 %

Local category: Erdgas
Local subcategory: Kraftwerke






